Used 
for bedspreads, drapes, housecoats, 
beach wear.

Face
The front or finished side of a fabric; 
the side designed to be seen.

The name derives 
from the village of Linsey, Suffolk, 
England.

Maillot
Maillot is tights for dancers or gymnasts; 
jersey; a woman’s one-piece bathing suit.

Seal ring
A finger ring engraved with a seal; 
signet ring.

Condition 
(worn and faded garments may have 
reduced ratings);
